# Licence texts under LICENSES/ are evidence, not prose: they are the exact
# bytes a distribution has to carry, and some of them are compared against
# upstream blobs to prove that a grant was received (see NOTICE.md §2).  Letting
# `core.autocrlf` rewrite their line endings on checkout would make that
# comparison fail on a fresh clone for reasons that have nothing to do with the
# licence.  `-text` disables all conversion for these paths.
LICENSES/** -text
